      "archaeologicalRemains": "traces",
      "details": "<table class=\"waffle\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td class=\"s3 changed\" dir=\"ltr\">While the grove itself dates to the Regal Period (753\u2013509 BCE), the initial remains of building dates back to the first century CE. Later the building was expanded and modificated in the second century, and eventually re-built in the fourth century with a different orientation and a distinctive semi-basilical floor plan. It was abandoned in the late fourth or early fifth century.<br /><br /></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>",
